# package.json's "files" allowlist already keeps these out of anything packed
# from this directory; this file is a second guard for the case that matters:
# the compiled addon in build/ is platform-specific and must never be installed
# on another machine.
#
# Note that the LSP package does NOT bundle this folder (npm would copy the
# installed directory verbatim, build/ included). It vendors the grammar sources
# at pack time instead — see ../scripts/prepack-grammar.js.
build/
node_modules/
